WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.250
Week 5: Location, Condition, and Existence. locate a place describe a temporary condition say what is available

2
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:31.191
Read for the situation. El centro de información está junto a la entrada. Hay mapas gratis sobre el mostrador, pero la cafetería está cerrada. Los baños están al final del pasillo. The information center is next to the entrance. There are free maps on the counter, but the cafeteria is closed. The restrooms are at the end of the hallway.

3
00:00:31.191 --> 00:00:39.953
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:39.953 --> 00:00:46.837
Reading activities. Reading activity 10; Reading activity 11; Reading activity 12

5
00:00:46.837 --> 00:00:54.831
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.831 --> 00:01:23.905
Model language. El mostrador de información está junto a la entrada. — The information counter is next to the entrance. Hay mapas gratis sobre el mostrador. — There are free maps on the counter. La cafetería está cerrada hoy. — The café is closed today. Los baños están al final del pasillo. — The restrooms are at the end of the hallway. No hay nadie en la entrada ahora. — There is no one at the entrance now.

7
00:01:23.905 --> 00:01:34.059
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
